<h3><u>Unnesso hai zakhm</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haay..<br />
Haaye...<br />
Gir kar kabhi uthe kabhi rakha zamee&#39;n pe sar<br />
ublaa lahu kabhi to sambhala kabhi jigar<br />
hasrat se ki khayam ki janib kabhi nazar<br />
karwat kabhi tadap ke idhar li kabhi udhar<br />
uth baithe jab..(2)<br />
to zakhmo se barchi ke phal gire<br />
teer aur tan me gadh gaye jab mu&#39; ke bal gire<br />
jungle se aai fatema zehra ki ye sadaa<br />
ummat ne mujhko loot liya wa mohammada<br />
is waqt kaun haqqe rifaqat kare adaa<br />
zainab se boli fatema zehra basad bukaa<br />
unnees so hai zakhm tane chaak chaak par<br />
zainab nikal hussain tadapta hai khaak par..(2)</p>

<p>1. Kis chaah se paala ise aanchal me chupaa kar<br />
mai jaagti rehti ise raato&#39;n ko sulaa kar<br />
chakki bhi jo peesi hai to godi me bitha kar<br />
kis haal me dekha hai ise dasht me aakar</p>

<p>2. Hai kaun jo mazloom ko teero&#39;n se bachaye<br />
sehroz ke pyase ko koi paani pilaye<br />
zakhmo mein bhari khaak koi aake chudaye<br />
har laash uthayi hai ise kaun uthaye</p>

<p>3. Abbas ke marne se kamar toot chuki hai<br />
akbar ke bichhad jaane se beenai gai hai<br />
in ankho&#39;n me besheer ki turbat bhi bani hai<br />
hai aakhri lamhaat ajal sar pe khadi hai</p>

<p>4. Kuch der me khanjar mere bache pe chalega<br />
afsos dame zibha bhi pani na milega<br />
khanjar ke kai zarbo se sar iska katega<br />
ghayyur hai beta mera hargiz na kahega</p>

<p>5. Baqi hai abhi jaan tera bhai hai zinda<br />
ghode kahin dauda na de bedard hai aada<br />
hay hay koi bekas ko nahi puchne wala<br />
bhai se mohabbat hai to maqtal me chali aa</p>

<p>6. Ye bayn mai sunti hu tere baba ali se<br />
hojaenge pamaal abhi laashe sabhi ke<br />
kuch marhale baqi hai ghareebul watani ke<br />
jaa haal zara dekh le is pyaase akhi ke</p>

<p>7. Aajiz hai yaha aake to har ek sukhanwar<br />
farhaan anees e shahe wala hoke mazhar<br />
likh paya nahi aaj talak koi wo manzar<br />
jab kehti thi zainab se meri bibi tadapkar</p>

<p>unnees so hai zakhm tane chaak chaak par<br />
zainab nikal hussain tadapta hai khaak par..(3)</p>
</p>
